From 9048679576f5e263bdbc82f8a1702239291a4d8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:48:06 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Classic stack tab switcher (StackLayout) ported from Chromium
 90

Re-adds StackLayout/StackLayoutBase/Stack/OverlappingStack/StackTab/StackAnimation/StackScroller/
StackViewAnimation and TabListSceneLayer (Java) plus TabLayer/TabListSceneLayer (C++, cc::slim, jni_zero),
with card border/close-button drawables. LayoutManagerChromePhone returns StackLayout for LayoutType.HUB so
every entry point into the tab switcher shows the stack; LayoutTab regains the stack properties, Layout gets
notifySizeChanged, LayoutManagerImpl handles back press for it, thumbnail cache raised. Flat tab list, two
stacks (normal/incognito), no 3D tilt. --disable-stack-tab-switcher restores the Hub; TalkBack and incognito
lock fall back to the Hub.
